      "t": "Pictograph of a lightning bolt. The current meaning is a phonetic loan."
    },
    {
      "s": "shuowen_jiezi",
      "t": "神也。七月，陰气成，體自申束。从臼，自持也。吏臣（段注“臣”作“以” ）餔時聽事，申旦政也。凡申之屬皆从申。",
      "w": 1
    },
    {
      "s": "wiktionary",
      "t": "Pictogram (象形) — a bolt of lightning. Original character of 電 (OC *l'iːns, “lightning”) and 神 (OC *hlin, “god; deity; spirit”).\n; “to extend; to state; to request; to announce; again”\n; 9th earthly branch\n: For its association with the monkey, compare Proto-Tai *liːŋᴬ (“monkey”), Proto-Hmongic *ʔlinᴬ (“monkey”), and Proto-Mienic *ʔbiŋᴬ (“monkey”).\n; “Shanghai”"
    }
  ],
  "shuowen": "神也。七月，陰气成，體自申束。从臼，自持也。吏臣（段注“臣”作“以” ）餔時聽事，申旦政也。凡申之屬皆从申。",
  "shuowenExplanation": "spirit/divine. seven moon, the passive steam completed, body self 申 bind. Composed of 臼 and 自持也. government official minister （ section concentrate “ minister ” make “ using ”   ） eat time hear affair, 申 dawn government. All characters in the 申 category contain 申 as radical.",
